QuestGuidance.Register("en",145,{
[4609]="7002439F\n1\tDeliver the tough sword sheaths to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\030Collect tough sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou accepted a task from Frideric the Elder to acquire tough sword sheaths from the intelligent creatures in the Lone-lands. You can find Frideric the Elder within Ost Guruth.\n",
[4610]="70016B2D\n1\tEncourage the escaped spider to return to its cage\tKlintur's spider is north-west of the Shadowed Refuge. Klintur's spider keeps escaping from its cage. He asked you to find it and 'encourage' it to return, lest it bring an entire clutch back to free the others.\n2\tTalk to Klintur at the Shadowed Refuge\tKlintur is at the Shadowed Refuge, east of the spider-cages. Klintur will be pleased to hear that you 'encouraged' the spider to return to its cage.\n",
[4611]="7005FFA6\n1\tDefeat shadow-grims at Eiglinn\t\n2\tDefeat shadow-grims at Eiglinn (total: 8)\tShadow-grims can be found at Eiglinn in Câr Bronach. Summoned forth from the remnants of the Iron Crown's sorcery, shadow-grims roam the tainted lake of Eiglinn.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many shadow-grims at Eiglinn.\n",
[4612]="700661F6\n1\tTalk to Borhador\tArvaethor says his father is currently enjoying the view at Eilendoth and would enjoy your company once more. Talk to Borhador at Eilendoth.\n2\tLook at southern Ringló Vale from the top of the stairs\030Find a good place to look at southern Ringló Vale\030Look at Ethring\030Find a good place to look at Ethring\tBorhador asked you to to look upon Ringló Vale now that the dawnless day has passed. Look out at Ringlo Vale.\n3\tTalk to Borhador\tYou have looked upon Ringló Vale as Borhador asked, and should return to him with your thoughts. Talk to Borhador.\n",
[4613]="70053A98\n1\tDefeat Balchneth, the gate-keeper\tDefeat Balchneth, the gate-keeper.\n2\tFind Rauniel's chamber\tFind Rauniel's chamber.\n3\tDefeat Gwaurodel\tDefeat Gwaurodel.\n",
