[4621]="7006EEDD\n1\tDefeat Ekhamâti warriors (total: 8)\030Defeat Ekhamâti look-outs (total: 6)\030Defeat Ekhamâti champions (total: 3)\030Tend to wounded Subuzûri (total: 6)\tDefeat Ekhamâti forces around you and tend to the wounded Subuzûri in Nisigurûm.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm\tReturn to Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm in southern Imhûlar.\n",
[4622]="7003A41B\n1\tBring the letter to Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farm-house. You should bring the letter to Herubrand.\n2\tTalk to Gifemund\tGifemund is in the ore refinery building within Woodhurst, near the centre of the city. Herubrand told you to insinuate yourself into the good graces of Gifemund in order to learn what he has planned.\n3\tTalk to the mine overseer\tThe overseer is at Wid Isernore, just outside of Woodhurst. Gifemund told you to speak with the overseer of his mine and learn how you might help there.\n4\tCollect ore (total: 4)\tWid Isernore is filled with ore-bearing stone. The overseer asked that you gather ore for him.\n5\tTalk to the mine overseer\tThe mine overseer is at Wid Isernore. The ore you gathered should be returned to the mine overseer.\n",
[4623]="70007B8F\n1\tDefeat the ruin-web spinner\030Defeat the ruin-web trapper\030Defeat the ruin-web weaver\tThe elders of the spider-brood can be found in Amon Ros, west of Ost Guruth. Tortwil asked a favour of you: that you go to Amon Ros and slay the elders of the spider-brood.\n2\tTalk to Tortwil at Ost Guruth\tTortwil awaits your return in Ost Guruth, east of Amon Ros. Tortwil will be pleased to hear of your victory against the spider-elders of Amon Ros.\n",
[4624]="70058E25\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[4625]="70058E3D\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[4626]="70058784\n1\tDeliver five Elderslade supply packs to the Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster\tThe crafting recipes for Elderslade supply packs can be bartered for from the Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster. The Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster has asked you to bring them several Elderslade supply packs.\n",
[4627]="700589A5\n1\tDeliver the blackened claws to a collection box\030Collect blackened claws (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire blackened claws.\n",
[4628]="700589A6\n1\tDeliver the onyx scales to a collection box\030Collect onyx scales (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire onyx scales.\n",
[4629]="700589A4\n1\tDeliver the savage beaks to a collection box\030Collect savage beaks (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire savage beaks.\n",
[4630]="700589A7\n1\tDeliver the tufted ears to a collection box\030Collect tufted ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire tufted ears.\n",
[4631]="700190E9\n1\tTalk to Pennasseth\030Talk to Meluibrennil\030Talk to Naeris\tTuilinn has sent you to three Elves who each know an aspect of the tale of the romance of Elessar and Undómiel. From Cerin Amroth, Pennasseth can be found to the south-west at Cerin Nauth. Naeris is in the Peaceful Glade, due east. Meluibrennil is in Bain Gwaloth a short ways to the south-east.\n2\tTalk to Tuilinn\tTuilinn awaits you atop the flet at Cerin Amroth. You should return to Tuilinn now that you have heard the tale of Elessar and Undómiel.\n",
[4632]="70019D2E\n1\tTalk to Milwen in Cerin Amroth\tMilwen can be found on the western side of the hill of Cerin Amroth, by the arches. Cerin Amroth is north of Caras Galadhon. Miluiel has sent you to retrieve a bloom of elanor from Milwen at Cerin Amroth, in order to convince Aragorn to return to the hill despite his mysterious refusal to do so.\n2\tBring the Bloom of Elanor to Aragorn\tAragorn is at the Company's Pavilion inside Caras Galadhon, south of Cerin Amroth. You have been given a bloom of elanor to give to Aragorn, and Milwen is certain that it will convince him to return to the hill.\n3\tTalk to Miluiel\tMiluiel is outside the Company's Pavilion, in Caras Galadhon. Aragorn has given his reasons for not returning to Cerin Amroth, and you should tell them now to Miluiel.\n",
[4633]="700466D2\n1\tFind Elfhelm in Minas Tirith\tElfhelm wants to meet you in the Old Guest-house on the First Circle of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Elfhelm\tYou should talk to Elfhelm in the Old Guest-house in after-battle Minas Tirith.\n3\tFind the hilt of Éowyn's sword\tElfhelm has asked you to search the after-battle Pelennor for Éowyn's sword.\n4\tTalk to Elfhelm\tYou should talk to Elfhelm, who can be found in the Old Guest-house on the First Circle of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n5\tTalk to Éomer\tYou should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[4634]="7000D6B7\n1\tDefeat darkwater in Imlad Balchorth (total: 10)\tDarkwater can be found in Imlad Balchorth, west of Myrkworth. Sigar has asked you to destroy the darkwater in Imlad Balchorth.\n2\tTalk to Sigar\tSigar is at Myrkworth, east of Imlad Balchorth. Having destroyed the darkwater as asked, return to Sigar in Myrkworth and tell him the deed is done.\n",
[4635]="7001E7EB\n1\tDispatch Hîshtgropor Scouts (total: 10)\tGarmadh-maudhûl can be found to the north-east of Mithechad by following a trail that traverses up the mountain. Eirien has asked you to defeat any scouts that you encounter in the area surrounding Garmadh-maudhûl.\n2\tTalk to Eirien in Mithechad\tEinior is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl. You should return to Eirien and inform her of your deed.\n",
[4636]="70037841\n1\tDefeat White Hand Orcs\tThe White Hand Orcs are not pleased to see an invader in their camp. You should defeat as many of them as possible while searching for their leader.\n2\tDefeat White Hand Orcs (total: 4)\tThe White Hand Orcs are not pleased to see an invader in their camp. You should defeat as many of them as possible while searching for their leader.\n3\tCompleted\tMany White Hands Orcs were defeated by you while while you made your way through their camp.\n",
[4637]="7000808C\n1\tDefeat bears in Fornost (total: 3)\030Defeat boars in Fornost (total: 3)\030Defeat aurochs in Fornost (total: 3)\tCorrupted bears, boars, and aurochs roam the ruined streets of Fornost in the north-western North Downs. You should defeat many of the tortured, unhappy animals that roam northern Fornost.\n2\tReturn to Reynold Potts\tReynold Potts is at the Treasure Hunters' Camp, west of Fornost's keep. You should return to Reynold Potts.\n",
[4638]="7005B1F8\n1\tDefeat forge-masters (total: 4)\tEinar has suggested eliminating a few of the smithy's forge-masters. The forge-masters can be found in Gazat-fark and Durbángh.\n2\tTalk to Einar outside of Gazat-fark\tEinar will want to hear back from you. He can be found outside Gazat-fark.\n",
[4639]="7003040F\n1\tDefeat Wold marsh-flies (total: 10)\tThe bog to the west of Harwick is inhabited by a swarm of Marsh-flies. You should defeat marsh-flies for disturbing the sensitive ears of the pampered steeds in Harwick's stables.\n2\tTalk to Céolstan at the Harwick Stables\tCéolstan awaits your return inside of the stable-gates in Harwick. You should inform Céolstan that his horses may now sleep easier, for you have silenced the noise-makers that disturbed their rest.\n",
[4640]="7005B1F4\n1\tDefeat Orc smiths (total: 8)\tEinar believes that defeating the Orc smiths in Gazat-fark and Durbángh could severely weaken Gorgar's forces.\n2\tTalk to Einar outside of Gazat-fark\tYou have defeated many Orc smiths. Einar, who is waiting outside of Gazat-fark, will be pleased to hear it.\n",
})
